{
  "id": 8867157868743,
  "title": "Christmas Bedding Quilt – Soft Microfiber Holiday Bedsprea - Design 06",
  "handle": "christmas-bedding-quilt-soft-microfiber-holiday-bedsprea-design-06",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the festive spirit with the Jeminise Christmas Quilt Set, designed to bring warmth and holiday cheer to your home. Crafted from soft, lightweight microfiber, this quilt offers exceptional comfort and breathability, making it perfect for year-round use. Its vibrant festive prints will add a cheerful touch to any room, making it an ideal gift for family and friends during the holiday season or for any special occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Features bright, high-quality Christmas prints that create a warm, joyful atmosphere, perfect for holiday decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made of soft, lightweight microfiber for warmth in winter and coolness in warmer months, ensuring year-round versatility.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A cozy and meaningful present for loved ones during Christmas, New Year, birthdays, or holiday celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle, tumble dry low or air dry, and fade-resistant for lasting softness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes one quilt, perfect for immediate use or gifting.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable with cold water on gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or air dry.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
